  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HEB 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noolwekyo tulekeraawo okuyiga ebintu bya Kristo ebisookerwako, tukule mu by'omwoyo. Tulekeraawo okwogera ku bisookerwako byokka, ng'okwenenya ebikolwa ebireeta okufa, by'ebikolwa eby'obulombolombo, naye tuteekwa n'okuba n'okukkiriza mu Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tulekeraawo okuyigiriza obulombolombo obw'okubatizibwa, n'obw'okussibwako emikono, n'enjigiriza ey'okuzuukira kw'abafu, n'okusalirwa omusango ogw'olubeerera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda nga bw'asiima, tukule mu mwoyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kizibu okuzza mu kwenenya abo abaamala okufuna ekitangaala ne balega ku birungi eby'omu ggulu, ne bafuuka abassa ekimu mu Mwoyo Omutukuvu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne bamanya obulungi bw'ekigambo kya Katonda, ne balega ku maanyi ag'emirembe egigenda okujja,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naye ne bava ku Katonda. Baba bakomerera Omwana wa Katonda omulundi ogwokubiri, ne bamuswaza mu lwatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ettaka ligasa omulimi, bwe lifuna obulungi enkuba, ne lisigibwamu ensigo era ne muvaamu ebibala ebirungi. Ne Katonda aliwa omukisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye bwe libaza amatovu, n'amaggwa, ettaka eryo teriba lya mugaso liba kumpi n'okukolimirwa. Ku nkomerero, ebimezeeko byokebwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye abaagalwa, newaakubadde twogera bwe tutyo mmwe tetubabuusabuusa. Tumanyi nga mulina ebintu ebirungi era mukola ebintu ebiraga nti muli mu kkubo ery'obulokozi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubanga Katonda mwenkanya tayinza kwerabira mulimu gwammwe omunene bwe gutyo, n'okwagala kwe mwagala erinnya lye, era amanyi bwe mwaweereza abantu be, era bwe mukyeyongera okubaweereza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era twagala buli omu ku mmwe yeeyongere okulaganga obunyiikivu obwo okutuusiza ddala ku nkomerero, lwe mulifuna ekyo kye musuubira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tetwagala mube bagayaavu, wabula mube ng'abo abakkiriza era abagumiikiriza ne bafuna ekyasuubizibwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obukakafu bw'Ebisuubizo bya Katonda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda bwe yasuubiza Ibulayimu, nga bwe wataali mulala gw'ayinza kwerayirira amusinga, yeerayirira yekka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yalayira ng'agamba nti, \"Ndikuweera ddala omukisa, era n'okukwaza nnaakwazanga.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bw'atyo Ibulayimu bwe yalindirira n'obugumiikiriza, n'aweebwa ekyasuubizibwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu balayira omuntu abasinga obukulu, ku nkomerero kye balayidde kye kisalawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Katonda bw'atyo, kyeyava ateekawo ekirayiro ng'ayagala okukakasiza ddala abasika b'ekisuubizo nti talijjulula ekyo kye yasuubiza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda yakikola bw'atyo, okutulaga ebintu bibiri ebitajjulukuka, nti akuuma ekisuubizo kye awamu n'ekirayiro kye. Talimba. Noolwekyo ffe abaddukira gy'ali okutulokola, tusaana okuba abagumu kubanga talirema kutuwa ebyo bye yasuubiza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Essuubi eryo lye linywereza ddala emmeeme zaffe ng'ennanga bw'enyweza eryato. Essuubi eryo lituyingiza munda w'eggigi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu eyatusooka yo, eyo gye yayingira ku lwaffe, bwe yafuuka Kabona Asinga Obukulu ow'emirembe gyonna, ng'olubu lwa Merukizeddeeki bwe luli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
